  <OE_Trophy_SampleCollector_P.label>卓越镇魂地藏</OE_Trophy_SampleCollector_P.label>
  <!-- EN: One of the forgotten research objects of Mayuri Kurotsuchi. The darts of this paragon weapon contain an unstable toxin that randomly affects the target. It is not recommended to use in combat, since the effects can randomly debuff or buff the target.\n\nThis is a rare trophy weapon.\n\nFeature: deals unstable toxin damage that applies various random effects. -->
  <OE_Trophy_SampleCollector_P.description>黑崎狂三郎被遗忘的研究对象之一。这件卓越武器的飞镖含有不稳定的毒素，会随机影响目标。不建议在战斗中使用，因为效果可能会随机削弱或增强目标。\n\n这是一种稀有的战利品武器。\n\n特性：造成不稳定的毒素伤害，产生各种随机效果。</OE_Trophy_SampleCollector_P.description>
