  <!-- EN: Paragon Titanstrike -->
  <OE_Trophy_UnstableGun_P.label>卓越泰坦打击</OE_Trophy_UnstableGun_P.label>
  <!-- EN: This is a prohibited paragon weapon in Obsidia Empire and can only be obtained illegally. Due to a poorly designed energy delivery system, the weapon is quite weak, but there is a 5% chance that the weapon can release a huge amount of energy at once, causing incredible damage.\n\nThis is a rare trophy weapon.\n\nFeature: has a 5% chance of dealing incredible damage. -->
  <OE_Trophy_UnstableGun_P.description>这是黑曜石帝国禁止的卓越武器，只能通过非法途径获得。由于能量传输系统设计不良，武器相当脆弱，但有5%的几率武器能一次性释放巨大能量，造成难以置信的伤害。\n\n这是一种稀有的战利品武器。\n\n特性：有5%几率造成难以置信的伤害。</OE_Trophy_UnstableGun_P.description>
